      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Combining like bases and then pairing them, \\[ \\begin{aligned} 4^4\\cdot4^9\\cdot9^4\\cdot9^9 &=4^{13}9^{13}\\\\ &=(4\\cdot9)^{13}\\\\ &=36^{13}. \\end{aligned} \\] Thus the correct answer is C.",
